    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "RAY COOKE AUCTIONEERS are delighted to present this excellent two-bedroom apartment to the market ideally located on the first floor of The Academy Building within the exclusive Park West Pointe development. \r\n\r\nThis location is ever sought after as it is situated within walking distance of Park West Business Park and the new Park West train station bringing you into Heuston Station in minutes. The M50 Motorway, The Red Cow Luas Stop and Clondalkin & Palmerstown Villages are all very easily accessible. \r\n\r\nBright, airy and most spacious internal living accommodation of c. 62 sqm comprises of entrance hallway, storage room, large open plan lounge/dining area, fully fitted kitchen, main family bathroom, two double bedrooms with built in wardrobes and ensuite bathroom. Sliding doors from the living room open onto a low maintenance balcony with a highly sought after south facing orientation making it perfect for relaxing on them sunny summer evenings. \r\n\r\nNo. 62 is presented in great condition throughout having been lovingly maintained by its current owner with no expense spared when upgrading in recent years, it has just been freshly painted throughout and new ensuite shower unit has been installed. It has plenty of additional features such as designated underground parking space, built in storage, new water pressure pump and top-quality integrated appliances. This apartment is ideal for first time buyers looking to get on the property ladder but equally likely to be a hit with investors due to the attractive yields on offer locally. \r\n\r\nEarly viewing is highly advised, call Ray Cooke Auctioneers for further information or to arrange viewing! \r\n\r\nAdditional Features; \r\n- c. 62 sqm \r\n- BER B\r\n- Management fees c 2,200 per annum \r\n- 2 bed / 2 bath \r\n- Great condition throughout \r\n- Tastefully decorated from top to bottom \r\n- Freshly painted \r\n- Situated on the first floor\r\n- Top quality fixtures & fittings \r\n- Top quality flooring \r\n- Two large double bedrooms\r\n- Built in wardrobes \r\n- Main family bathroom \r\n- Master ensuite \r\n- Ensuite recently renovated \r\n- Fully fitted kitchen \r\n- Balcony off living room \r\n- Electric heating\r\n- New water pressure pump \r\n- Designated underground parking space \r\n- Ample visitors parking space\r\n- No onward chain \r\n- Adjacent to the train station \r\n- Heuston Station easily accessible \r\n- The Luas & M50 Motorway both within easy reach\r\n- Highly sought-after development \r\n- Ideal for both 1st time buyers & investors\r\n- Viewing highly advised! \r\n\r\nDirections\r\nUpon entering Park West, proceed towards the Aspect Hotel. At the roundabout before the hotel turn left onto Park West Road. Proceed ahead and the development can be found on your right-hand side above the stone steps. The Academy Building is located on the left-hand side."
      },
